==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Vespiquen|32}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*'''Pierce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Anorith|27}} and {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Kabuto|39}}, both from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

